(
    title: "Spike\'s Peak",
    description: Some("Spike climbs five screens from the meadows up through rocky ledges and snowfield to the summit, dodging diving eagles, bears, rockslides and ice patches on the way. A bar under the score is his body heat, and it shrinks the higher and colder he gets — reach the peak before it runs out, grabbing gold nuggets and ice diamonds as you go."),
